                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Unmanned Aerial Vehicle imagery from 2015 and 2017 over an unplanned settlement in Kigali, Rwanda. These images were used for the change detection studies published in the article:<br>Gevaert, C. M., Persello, C., Sliuzas, R. V., & Vosselman, G. (2020). Monitoring household upgrading in unplanned settlements with unmanned aerial vehicles. International Journal of Applied Earth Observation and Geoinformation (JAG), 90, 1-6. [102117]. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jag.2020.102117</p>"
